  "goodToKnow": "Die Inschrift is an inscription on stone, metal or a monument: eine lateinische Inschrift, die Inschrift auf dem Denkmal. Above the entrance to the Reichstag in Berlin, the inscription reads DEM DEUTSCHEN VOLKE (to the German people), added in 1916. Wedding rings in Germany often have an Inschrift (engraving) inside, usually the names and date. From in + die Schrift (writing). Plural: die Inschriften."
